      "role": "user",
      "content": "it just feels like there's no point in even trying to \"reach out\" or anything. everyone says things get better but they don't. i've been running on empty for years and now that he's gone, i just feel empty. like the purpose is just... gone. it feels more logical to just let go than to keep dragging this around.",
